  // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // FORCE MARKER + TEMPT WHISPER SYSTEM — Tempt Fate discovery via diegetic
  // prompt for EXTERNAL constraint moments. Parallel to the Friction → Petition
  // Whisper flow, but reserved for higher-stakes situations: physical
  // obstruction, institutional refusal, fatal events, and time-locked moments.
  // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
