              // LATE-ARRIVING image charge: scene finalized before this render
              // completed (typical for setting image and staged-hero phases that
              // render after text mounts). Retroactively update the last-scene
              // total so the charge isn't silently bled into the next scene's
              // accumulator when _ensureSceneCostAcc lazy-inits a fresh one.
