  // ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // STORY QUALITY OBSERVATORY — Phase 2: distribution AGGREGATORS (Roman 2026-06-21)
  // Pure functions over an array of captured [TAG] lines. Source-agnostic: default to
