      L.push('  NEVER expository ("I\'m the kind of man who…") — reveal through diction and attitude, not a summary of themselves.');
      L.push('  VARY THE SHAPE per character so entrances never calcify: a threat, a deflection, a tenderness, a joke, a command, a provocation, a too-honest admission — never the same rhythm twice.');
