  // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // DOGMA DISCOURSE — Partial-adoption voice layer for Dogma
  // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // Dogma is culturally dominant in influence but geographically and
  // socially uneven. This layer surfaces context-conditioned voices —
  // corporate / elite / practical / resistant / dismissive — so scenes
  // feel like participation is technically optional but practically
  // expected in the right rooms, and still contestable in the wrong ones.
  //
  // Governance (encoded in directive, non-negotiable):
