        lines.push('    - TRACEABILITY: every amplified element must map directly back to the original attraction trigger established by world/flavor/archetype. Every distortion must affect how that SAME trigger is acted upon \u2014 not create a different trigger. No new causes may be introduced under this pull.');
        lines.push('    - Behavior test: for any obsessive beat on-page, you must be able to answer: (a) which Amplifies/Distorts axis produced it, and (b) which original engine trigger it traces back to. If either answer is absent, the beat is random escalation, not expression.');
