      cost: 'Being wrong risks catastrophic consequences: death, ruin, betrayal of others who depend on the reading, collapse of the role or world order built around their interpretation.',
      fit: 'This specific pairing activates or fulfills the prophecy in a way that cannot occur with any other person. Their conflicting interpretations only exist BECAUSE of who they are to each other \u2014 remove one and the other\'s reading has no counterweight.',
