        'Phase 2 \u2014 The other character challenges or disrupts the current identity \u2014 not by accusing, but by responding to the part that shouldn\'t be there yet.',
        'Phase 3 \u2014 Tension escalates as maintaining the old self becomes harder in their presence.',
