  // ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // CONTEMPORARY ANCESTRY DIRECTIVE (Roman 2026-06-11 Phase 2 — Modern path)
  //
  // The contemporary semantic contract from
  // [[project_historical_compatibility_resolver]]:
  //   Modern / Dystopia / SciFi / Cyber / Post-apoc worlds →
  //     Ancestry is an APPEARANCE + HERITAGE + NAMING + CULTURAL MEMORY
  //     signal. NOT worldbuilding. NOT setting replacement.
  //     "Manhattan billionaire of Inuit heritage" does NOT move story to
