      // crisis register in the heroine profile — so even a genuine flood is not the same four
      // sentences every time.
      var _crisisStock = '\n\nCALCIFIED CRISIS REACTIONS (HARD — these stock physiological beats have collapsed protagonists into one reaction across plays; do NOT default to them as the crisis response — vary or replace, and let the protagonist\'s temperament/archetype shape how she meets stress):\n  ✗ "the room tilted / spun / swayed / lurched"\n  ✗ "her hands would not work / were useless / trembled uselessly / shook"\n  ✗ "her breath caught / snagged / hitched"\n  ✗ "her heart pounded / raced / thundered / hammered / stuttered"';
