      var _attractionStock = '\n\nATTRACTION-LANGUAGE SATURATION (HARD — express the relationship through CONSEQUENCE/DEPENDENCY/UNCERTAINTY/MEMORY/CHOICE far more often than through these; when they DO appear, once is enough, do not stack them):\n  ⚠ "impossible not to notice / impossible to look away / could not look away"\n  ⚠ "the room reset / reorganized / went still around him" · "his presence filled the room"\n  ⚠ "magnetic / gorgeous / devastating" as a stand-in for what he MEANS to her\n  ⚠ "the air between them" · "every nerve / her whole body / her skin knew before her mind did"\n  ⚠ "heat" / "pupils dilating" / "breath she did not know she was holding" as the recurring beat';
