  // ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // ROMANCE SATURATION VALIDATOR (Roman 2026-06-16, Part 9). Synchronous, regex-based,
  // per-scene (no LLM cost). Romance must DOMINATE the story; attraction LANGUAGE must not
