  // engine and (2) a SPECIFIC FEATURE ANCHOR from the LI Bible, and injects
  // both as HARD constraints Haiku fills in. WEIGHTED, not deterministic, so
  // we don't trade one fossil (strategist) for another (always-attraction):
  //   LOOMING / SHARED_HISTORY (LI wanted):  attraction 80 / desire 15 / strategist 5
