        + '\n  ' + p(r.movesByThereforeBut) + ' moves by therefore/but ("and then"×' + r.andThenCount + ', causal×' + r.causalConnectorCount + ')'
        + '\n  ' + p(r.descriptionDistributed) + ' description distributed (densest 40w window: ' + r.maxTraitsIn40wWindow + ' traits; dump at 4+)'
