    MORAL_CATASTROPHE:  'The spine is built around a MORAL CATASTROPHE — harm she caused, someone she ruined, a buried wrong surfacing, a cover-up unraveling, her complicity coming to light. The external goal orbits consequence, exposure, or atonement, NOT a clean external mission. The threat comes from her own past act, not an outside rival.'
