    lines.push('  • Maintain character continuity (the LI knows what they know, doesn\'t suddenly forget cover/agenda/role)');
    lines.push('  • Stay in-world (do not reference modern-Earth things in sci-fi or fantasy worlds, do not break species/era constraints)');
    lines.push('  • Engage authentically with plot references THAT MATCH this bundle (see plot-reference handling below)');
