  // Free-form Petition / Tempt requests are honored by MEANING, not keywords.
  // While a Fate volatility window is open (1–3 scenes), this directive carries
  // the reader's raw wish and tells the model to deliver its spirit, scaled to
  // the request: a small wish stays a brief tilt; a SCENARIO request (heist,
  // survival ordeal, chase, masquerade…) is woven into the story as real scene
  // events across the window, within the established world/flavor/characters/
