  // Internal naming convention: avoidance / dwell are intentionally
  // genre-neutral. The conceptual pair "suppression / curiosity" lives
  // only in design conversation and the memory file — NEVER in code
  // or prompts, to avoid biasing future implementation toward treating
  // one pole as "better."
  // ── STORY LENGTH PROFILE HELPERS (2026-05-14 architecture) ──────────
  // Taste is NO LONGER a user-facing premium tier. It's internal
