  // every scene. One probe maximum per scene. Schedules below are
  // expressed in 1-indexed player-facing scene numbers (Scene 1 =
  // sceneNum 1) for readability. Internal sceneIdx is 0-indexed; the
  // helpers convert.
  //
  // Design intent (locked 2026-05-14):
