    block += '- Brood-Bound feels indefinite instead of impending → REJECT\n';
    block += '- No urgency in decisions despite rising pressure → REJECT\n';
    block += '- Pressure increases identically each scene (must vary) → REJECT\n';
    block += '- Critical stage persists indefinitely without countdown progression → REJECT\n';
    block += '- High pressure (≥65) has no sensory or behavioral impact in non-transformation scenes → REJECT\n';
