        out += '• THEY FIND WHAT HUMANS FUMBLE FOR: the same sense locates a partner\'s rhythm, wants, and tells at once — the sync humans grope blindly toward, a Favored finds immediately. With their stamina, the sex is "the earth moved" great nearly every time; the human rarely has had, or will have, its equal.\n';
