        out += '• "FLAVORED" (canon afterglow): when a First Favored MALE finishes inside a human, the human\'s skin carries faint First-Favored light-patterns for a few hours after. Humans call this being FLAVORED — half-mocking, half-envious, because a Favored chooses a human lover rarely (most aren\'t beautiful, confident, or aligned enough to be tolerated in their bed — like bedding an Olympic supermodel). Being seen Flavored is a quiet status-mark others notice and resent.' + (favMale ? ' (A male Favored is present — this may apply here.)' : '') + '\n';
