  // Storybound has two real Scene 1 codepaths, both reached by real users:
  //
  //   1. BACKGROUND PATH (this file, ~app.js:73059 startBackgroundStoryGeneration)
  //      Triggered by the "Generate Cover" → "Begin Story" parallel flow.
  //      Story prose is pre-generated while the user views the cover, then
  //      mounted on Begin click. Sys prompt is built INLINE in this function.
  //      Uses buildScene1IntroPrompt() (this file, just below) for the user
  //      message — that's where the heavy directive composition lives:
