  //      presence, structure example, validation contract, 4th/5th-person
  //      POV blocks, ending directive. CANONICAL for new Scene 1 features.
  //
  //   2. FOREGROUND PATH (app.js around line 109200, direct Begin Story flow)
  //      Triggered when the user skips cover generation and clicks Begin
  //      directly. Sys prompt is built via the standard fullSys composition
  //      chain (~app.js:131262), which includes _scene1Contract built by
  //      its own logic at ~app.js:130891+. That contract has its own
  //      OPENING/MICRO/anchor rules — separate from buildScene1IntroPrompt.
  //
  // KNOWN DRIFT RISK: New Scene 1 directives added to buildScene1IntroPrompt
  // do NOT automatically apply to the foreground path. When adding a new
  // hard rule, decide consciously: (a) add it here only (background-canonical),
  // (b) mirror it into _scene1Contract (foreground), or (c) extract a shared
  // composer (eventual unification — TODO).
  //
  // VALIDATOR (below): runs ONLY on the background path's output. Foreground
  // currently has no post-gen validator. This is the next divergence to close
  // when validator coverage feels worth duplicating.
  // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  // Lightweight semantic check on the micro-expression's two options.
