  // ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  // LI SOCIAL-PROOF MANDATE — "the world orbits him before the PC does"
  //
  // Contract: the FIRST meaningful reference to the love interest in any
  // scene's prose must include OBSERVABLE third-party reaction (people
  // checking whether he's coming, rumors / reputation, conversations
  // pausing, deference, eyes tracking him, women competing for him,
  // leaders deferring). Status labels alone ("powerful", "rich",
