      p0.li_visibility_phase = 'absent';
      p0.props_present = [];
      // ── PHASE 0 CAMERA GATE (2026-05-22, expanded) ─────────────────
      // Pre-fix: hard-mandated over_shoulder_pc unless emotional-opener
      // triggered close_pc + pc_reaction. Result: every hero was a wide
      // static back-shot. User: "the framing for the hero shot is so
      // flat... this is killing me."
      // Post-fix: phase 0 picks from a richer enum based on the scene's
      // tone. Allowed framings:
      //   CALM ESTABLISH (low drama):
