  // ── LI INITIATIVE DIRECTIVE (2026-05-22) ───────────────────────
  // The LI is not a reactive object that mirrors player actions —
  // they have NEEDS, DESIRES, CONFESSIONS, TEMPTATIONS of their own
  // and should surface them as the scene unfolds.
  //
  // Returns a prompt block that tells the LLM:
  //   - 30-50% of LI dialogue beats should include an INITIATIVE
  //     BEAT — the LI ASKS for something specific, CONFESSES a want,
  //     TEMPTS the player into a particular act, or NAMES a need
