  // ── LITERARY CRAFT DIRECTIVE (2026-05-22) ──────────────────────
  // Tighter subset of the CG screenplay DRAMATIZATION ADAPTER
  // DOCTRINE. Literary mode KEEPS the right to be quiet, abstract,
  // interior, contemplative — that's the medium. But the craft
