  // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // OAS REGISTER MIRRORING — Slice 1 (added 2026-05-17)
  // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // Three-mode behavioral calibration of Grok's default register, mirroring
  // the player's accumulated interest signals. Activates state.chargeGravity
  // as its first Phase 1B read site (was Phase 1A telemetry only).
  //
  //   • lean_in   — sustained signals of explicit-content preference. Skip
  //                 metaphor cinesequence rotation entirely; always OAS;
  //                 full match register.
  //   • default   — current behavior. Alternation (cine #1, OAS #2, ...);
  //                 OAS matches user fully.
  //   • reserved  — sustained signals of avoidance. Cinesequence rotation
  //                 continues; OAS register stays "capable but reserved"
  //                 (LI knows the words, doesn't lead with them); PC's
  //                 explicit input THIS turn snaps register to full match
  //                 for THIS response.
