      '- RHYTHM AS INTIMACY (small moments of breath, NOT moments of friction — keeps the scene feeling like fantasy with depth, not documentary):',
      '   Continuous escalation + verbally dense + emotionally "on" is the AI-intimacy failure mode. Add rhythm not via AWKWARDNESS but via INTIMATE BREATH:',
      '   • PAUSES — a beat where both characters stop and just BREATHE together. Not "frozen, unsure" — landed, present, the moment caught in amber for one second.',
