  // Called by WishSequence.resolve() when mode === 'cg'. In-scope: the
  // face transform happens at the image layer (Kontext already rebuilt
  // the locked face master in Beat 3's pre-fire), so we just persist the
  // change downstream by overwriting state.liFaceMasterUrl / pcFaceMasterUrl
  // with the transformed URL, and stash a single-turn narrative directive
  // for the NEXT scene's LLM call. Out-of-scope: stash _pendingFateRupture
