    enemies: {
      face: 'cold_dismissal',
      prompt: '[INTIMATE SCENE COMPLETED — ENEMIES AFTERGLOW. The heat was rage redirected, and now the rage returns. Bodies separate fast. Eye contact broken or held hard. Clothes back on quickly, tightly. The line that comes next is sharp, wounded, or finalizing — "You got what you wanted. Now get out." / "Don\'t make this mean something." / "We never speak of this." NOT a tender afterglow. NOT a recovery into softness. Render the recognition that the heat did not change the war.]'
    },
