  // 2026-05-31 (Roman, CG Slice E): wound vortex 5 surface forms → CG shot
  // grammar. Mirror of the literary cadence gate (in
  // buildAPlotPressureDirective) — same state slot
  // (state._lastWoundVortexAtTurn), same ~once-per-5 cadence. CG translates
  // each surface form into panel/shot grammar instead of literary prose:
  //   REMEMBERED_LOOK       → flashback INSET panel / match-cut between
  //                            current face and memory face
  //   REMEMBERED_PHRASE     → caption-box echo of remembered line over
  //                            current action panel
