  // Only runs in GN sessions — prose has its own update paths at
  // app.js:121124 / 121254 / 121342 that GN never hits, so without this
  // helper Phase 3 desire-bias would be silently dead in pure-GN play.
  //
  // Accumulation model: absolute, clamped to [0, 1]. Identical semantics
