      spaces: ['an estate library too large for one man to live in alone','a private members\' club his grandfather founded','the family seat, a house older than the country around it','a box at the opera kept in the family name','the long gallery of ancestors he answers to'],
      style: ['inherited tailoring, beautifully worn, nothing new-looking','a signet ring older than he is; quality that predates him','restraint as a class signal — he would never be caught trying'],
      ritual: ['he walks the estate himself at first light, the way his father did','a fixed day each week settling the family\'s debts and obligations','long solitary hours in the archive with the things only he still values'],
