        var fameLine = lead + '• RECOGNITION (FAME-GATED, HARD): ONLY if the couple is genuinely PUBLICLY KNOWN — a famous/notorious LI, OR they have CLAIMED a public reality-bending event (they are "the ones from the song / the ballad / the thing everyone is debating") — may a stranger recognize the COUPLE: "wait — you\'re ' + ((s.playerName || 'her') + ' and ' + (s.loveInterestName || 'him')) + '? from the —?", fan energy / awe / a phone already up / a demand. If they are NOT publicly known, a stranger must NEVER recognize them as a couple. (Recognizing ONE of them from private history is the separate KNOW_FROM_BEFORE beat.)';
