              L.push('  • PROXY WAR: they are KNOWN ADVERSARIES already at war. He is NOT a stranger and NOT a tender memory — he is a PRESENT HOSTILE FORCE. In Scene 1 he is felt through his MOVES: an emissary in the room, the opposing brief, an offer with his fingerprints on its politeness, a decision that lands on her before she has finished her coffee. He need NOT be physically present.');
