    // [SCENE-WANT:PIPELINE] (Roman 2026-06-03) — the upstream emotional authority
    // chain audit: private_hope → scene_want → desire-target Roman% → ownership.
    // Reads sb_run_ledger (private_hope + scene_want populate from this build on;
