  // ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // TRANSITIONAL EXPRESSION PROBE — second class of micro-expression that
  // appears at scene TAIL. Defines behavior of the NEXT scene (verbal vs
  // silent intimacy). Bypasses LATE_MICRO_EXPRESSION validator via the
  // distinct marker name. Reuses existing scene_expression_mode click
  // handler (writes state._sceneExpression[axis]) and existing pill styling.
  //
  // Marker format:
  //   <<TRANSITIONAL_EXPRESSION>>
  //   There's a moment where he could say something—  [say it]  [leave it unspoken]
  //   <<CONTINUE_TRANSITIONAL>>
